# FM and PHYS tracks: set by type, browsed by kind across the engines (the engine follows the sound,
# the steps stay), their HOME knobs and EDIT pages, and every synth sounding while playing
tap HOME
turn ALGO 5
tap GLO
turn K1 4
tap SEL
expect type.5 44
tap HOME
# a step and a chord on the FM track
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
holdkey w0
turn K3 4
releasekey w0
tapkey w8
expect gate.5.0 1
expect chord.5.0 4
# HOME: FM's knobs (LEVEL 2 first)
tap HOME
turn K1 2
# PERC only: the browse moves this track from FM to PHYS, keeping its steps
hold SEL
turn PRESET 7
release SEL
expect list 7
turn PRESET 1
expect cat.5 6
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
expect cat.5 6
shot synths_home
# EDIT pages on the engine it is now
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 1
shot synths_edit
tap HOME
expect gate.5.0 1
expect chord.5.0 4
# track 7: PHYS by type
turn ALGO 1
tap GLO
turn K1 5
tap SEL
expect type.6 55
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tap HOME
# everything sounds
tap PLAY
peakreset
wait 2500
expect sounds.6 1
expect peak_min 5
tap PLAY
hold SEL
turn PRESET -7
release SEL
